{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"1":{"eng-name":"Purification (Kitab Al-Taharah)","ara-name":"كتاب الطهارة"}},"section_detail":{"1":{"hadithnumber_first":1,"hadithnumber_last":390,"arabicnumber_first":1,"arabicnumber_last":390}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":138,"arabicnumber":138,"text":"‘Ata’ b. Yasar, citant Ibn ‘Abbas رضي الله عنه, a dit : Voulez-vous que je vous dise comment le Messager d’Allah ﷺ faisait ses ablutions ? Il a alors fait les ablutions en lavant chaque membre une seule fois","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (157)"}],"reference":{"book":1,"hadith":138},"chapter":{"id":53,"ara-name":"باب الْوُضُوءِ مَرَّةً مَرَّةً","eng-name":"Performing [The Actions Of] Wudu' Once","isFirstHadith":true}}]}